Subject: [PATCH 30/65] Port the first spell effects and the effect bookkeeping

Cure Light/Serious Wounds (H085+$1CB8/$3298, H062+$253C, H063+$2ACC),
Cure Disease ($2E28, $0A1A, H062+$18AC), Neutralize Poison ($3552),
Enlarge ($1EBA) and Strength ($2BD4) with the caster level
(H063+$2FAA), the effect duration (H085+$0672) and H062+$1916/$19C2.
Effect handler call, effect removal and stat recompute (H062+$03F2,
$0452, $1952, $1A32) replace their stubs.  dax_test uses the new
error_message name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
